        "created_at": "2018-10-01T23:40:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Upshot: Everything is the better answer for the Spirits.</p>\n<p>(1) Yes, there’s nothing that prohibits that. (Note that normally, a single City will split its damage between Dahan.)</p>\n<p>(2) Yes. Other boosts (eg, from Events) would also apply.</p>\n<p>(3) No, as you say, they are damaging other Invaders.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>I updated <a href=\"https://querki.net/u/darker/spirit-island-faq/#!.7w4g8r9\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">one FAQ</a> to be clearer on (1), and <a href=\"https://querki.net/u/darker/spirit-island-faq/#!.9v5kcn7\" data-bbcode=\"true\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">added a FAQ</a> for (2) and (3).</p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:55:37.913Z",
