        "raw": "Upshot: Everything is the better answer for the Spirits.\n\n(1) Yes, there's nothing that prohibits that. (Note that normally, a single City will split its damage between Dahan.)\n\n(2) Yes. Other boosts (eg, from Events) would also apply.\n\n(3) No, as you say, they are damaging other Invaders.\n\n&nbsp;\n\nI updated [url=https://querki.net/u/darker/spirit-island-faq/#!.7w4g8r9]one FAQ[/url] to be clearer on (1), and [url=https://querki.net/u/darker/spirit-island-faq/#!.9v5kcn7]added a FAQ[/url] for (2) and (3).\n",
